    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPACE HOLE is a bite sized arcade game where you grow a tail of energy and deposit it into the SPACE HOLE while avoiding enemies and obstacles. Dunking large amounts of energy into the SPACE HOLE will net you a point multiplier, but the more points you have will bring about more challenge -- so act fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple game expects no more than a minute or two of the player's time for a round. Try to beat your high score and earn bragging rights by topping the Steam Leaderboards, while enjoying a reactive music track from James Bennett.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a Mouse, a keyboard, or (preferably) a gamepad for this classic two button arcade game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPACE HOLE is a bite sized arcade game where you grow a tail of energy and deposit it into the SPACE HOLE while avoiding enemies and obstacles. Dunking large amounts of energy into the SPACE HOLE will net you a point multiplier, but the more points you have will bring about more challenge -- so act fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple game expects no more than a minute or two of the player's time for a round. Try to beat your high score and earn bragging rights by topping the Steam Leaderboards, while enjoying a reactive music track from James Bennett.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a Mouse, a keyboard, or (preferably) a gamepad for this classic two button arcade game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Collect energy, grow your tail, and fill the SPACE HOLE in this bite sized arcade game.",
